   "short": false,
   "hook": "What to see in Seoul right now",
   "name_chips": true,
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "anchor",
     "text": "If you catch it, where do you go? Our travel expert: Professor Indoor. Self-certified. Online.",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep03_24.mp3",
     "shot": "cam",
     "cam": [
      960,
      500,
      1.1
     ],
     "ease": 0.14,
     "cam_id": "two",
     "push": false
    },
    {
     "who": "guest",
     "text": "I've been there!",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep03_25.mp3",
     "shot": "cam",
     "cam": [
      2560,
      470,
      1.3
     ],
     "ease": 0.12,
     "cam_id": "guest",
     "push": false
    },
    {
     "who": "anchor",
     "text": "Physically?",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep03_26.mp3",
     "shot": "cam",
     "cam": [
      960,
      500,
      1.1
     ],
     "ease": 0.14,
     "cam_id": "two",
     "push": false
    },
    {
     "who": "guest",
     "text": "...Emotionally.",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep03_27.mp3",
     "shot": "cam",
     "cam": [
      2560,
      470,
      1.3
     ],
     "ease": 0.12,
     "cam_id": "guest",
     "push": false
    },
    {
     "who": "guest",
     "text": "Okay, facts. Seoul is running a welcome campaign for tourists through October eleventh, with a help desk near Myeongdong Station that offers interpretation in English, Chinese, and Japanese.",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep03_28.mp3",
     "shot": "k_screen",
     "cam_id": "screen_guest",
     "push": false,
     "screen": [
      "welcome",
      "myeongdong"
     ],
     "screen_split": [
      0.5
     ]
    },
    {
     "who": "panel",
     "text": "Help desks and interpreters. That's service.",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep03_29.mp3",
     "shot": "cam",
     "cam": [
      960,
      500,
      1.1
     ],
     "ease": 0.14,
     "cam_id": "two",
     "push": false
    },
    {
     "who": "guest",
     "text": "From October seventh to eleventh, the K-Royal Culture Festival turns the five grand palaces and Jongmyo Shrine into stages.",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep03_30.mp3",
     "shot": "k_screen",
     "cam_id": "screen_guest",
     "push": false,
     "screen": [
      "palaces",
      "palaces2"
     ],
     "screen_split": [
      0.5
     ]
    },
    {
     "who": "guest",
     "text": "There is also a moonlight tour of Changdeokgung Palace, with sessions in English for foreign visitors.",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep03_31.mp3",
     "shot": "k_screen",
     "cam_id": "screen_guest",
     "push": false,
     "screen": "moonlight"
    },
    {
     "who": "panel",
     "text": "A palace at night. That's so romantic.",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep03_32.mp3",
     "shot": "cam",
     "cam": [
      960,
      500,
      1.1
     ],
     "ease": 0.14,
     "cam_id": "two",
     "push": false
    },
    {
     "who": "guest",
     "text": "I watched the whole thing on a live stream. Best seat in the house. No line, no crowds, and the snacks are twelve feet away.",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep03_33.mp3",
     "shot": "cam",
     "cam": [
      2560,
      470,
      1.3
     ],
     "ease": 0.12,
     "cam_id": "guest",
     "push": false
    },
    {
     "who": "anchor",
     "text": "That is... one way to travel.",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep03_34.mp3",
     "shot": "cam",
     "cam": [
      960,
      500,
      1.1
     ],
     "ease": 0.14,
     "cam_id": "two",
     "push": false
    },
    {
     "who": "guest",
     "text": "Now, the souvenir of the season: a cap. Seoul's city brand teamed up with a traditional-knot design brand, and one post about it got two point seven million views on Japanese social media. No ads.",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep03_35.mp3",
     "shot": "k_screen",
     "cam_id": "screen_guest",
     "push": false,
     "screen": [
      "cap"
     ]
    },
    {
     "who": "panel",
     "text": "Let me guess. It's Seoul-d out.",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep03_36.mp3",
     "shot": "cam",
     "cam": [
      960,
      500,
      1.1
     ],
     "ease": 0.14,
     "cam_id": "two",
     "push": false
    },
    {
     "who": "guest",
     "text": "I wouldn't know. I've never been there.",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep03_37.mp3",
     "shot": "cam",
     "cam": [
      2560,
      470,
      1.3
     ],
     "ease": 0.12,
     "cam_id": "guest",
     "push": false
    },
    {
     "who": "anchor",
     "text": "Emotionally?",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep03_38.mp3",
     "shot": "cam",
     "cam": [
      960,
      500,
      1.1
     ],
     "ease": 0.14,
     "cam_id": "two",
     "push": false
    },
    {
     "who": "guest",
     "text": "Emotionally, I own three.",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep03_39.mp3",
     "shot": "cam",
     "cam": [
      2560,
      470,
      1.3
     ],
     "ease": 0.12,
     "cam_id": "guest",
     "push": false
    }
   ]
  },
