   "short": false,
   "hook": "Korea's exports just hit a record",
   "name_chips": true,
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "anchor",
     "text": "Now, another record. Max Rise, our money and business analyst.",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep03_40.mp3",
     "shot": "cam",
     "cam": [
      960,
      500,
      1.1
     ],
     "ease": 0.14,
     "cam_id": "two",
     "push": false
    },
    {
     "who": "guest",
     "text": "Good news. The line went up.",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep03_41.mp3",
     "shot": "cam",
     "cam": [
      2560,
      470,
      1.3
     ],
     "ease": 0.12,
     "cam_id": "guest",
     "push": false
    },
    {
     "who": "guest",
     "text": "September exports: a hundred twenty-one billion dollars. A record. Up eighty-three percent.",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep03_42.mp3",
     "shot": "k_screen",
     "cam_id": "screen_guest",
     "push": false,
     "screen": "exports"
    },
    {
     "who": "panel",
     "text": "That's almost double!",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep03_43.mp3",
     "shot": "cam",
     "cam": [
      960,
      500,
      1.1
     ],
     "ease": 0.14,
     "cam_id": "two",
     "push": false
    },
    {
     "who": "guest",
     "text": "Chips did the heavy lifting. Over sixty billion dollars. Almost half of everything Korea sold.",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep03_44.mp3",
     "shot": "k_screen",
     "cam_id": "screen_guest",
     "push": false,
     "screen": "chips"
    },
    {
     "who": "panel",
     "text": "Finally, a chip Americans and Koreans both love.",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep03_45.mp3",
     "shot": "cam",
     "cam": [
      960,
      500,
      1.1
     ],
     "ease": 0.14,
     "cam_id": "two",
     "push": false
    },
    {
     "who": "anchor",
     "text": "Different chips.",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep03_46.mp3",
     "shot": "cam",
     "cam": [
      960,
      500,
      1.1
     ],
     "ease": 0.14,
     "cam_id": "two",
     "push": false
    },
    {
     "who": "panel",
     "text": "Mine come with dip.",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep03_47.mp3",
     "shot": "cam",
     "cam": [
      960,
      500,
      1.1
     ],
     "ease": 0.14,
     "cam_id": "two",
     "push": false
    },
    {
     "who": "guest",
     "text": "AI is hungry. Korea makes the memory chips it eats. And Korean chips remember everything.",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep03_48.mp3",
     "shot": "k_screen",
     "cam_id": "screen_guest",
     "push": false,
     "screen": "datacenter"
    },
    {
     "who": "panel",
     "text": "Unlike me at the grocery store.",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep03_49.mp3",
     "shot": "cam",
     "cam": [
      960,
      500,
      1.1
     ],
     "ease": 0.14,
     "cam_id": "two",
     "push": false
    },
    {
     "who": "guest",
     "text": "Nine months in, Korea has already beaten all of last year. A trillion dollars is next. Limit up!",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep03_50.mp3",
     "shot": "k_screen",
     "cam_id": "screen_guest",
     "push": false,
     "screen": [
      "ytd",
      "trillion"
     ],
     "screen_split": [
      0.5
     ]
    },
    {
     "who": "panel",
     "text": "A trillion! How many zeros is that?",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep03_51.mp3",
     "shot": "cam",
     "cam": [
      960,
      500,
      1.1
     ],
     "ease": 0.14,
     "cam_id": "two",
     "push": false
    },
    {
     "who": "anchor",
     "text": "Twelve. Thank you for the math.",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep03_52.mp3",
     "shot": "cam",
     "cam": [
      960,
      500,
      1.1
     ],
     "ease": 0.14,
     "cam_id": "two",
     "push": false
    },
    {
     "who": "guest",
     "text": "Seoul fever. Chip fever. Limit up!",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep03_53.mp3",
     "shot": "cam",
     "cam": [
      2560,
      470,
      1.3
     ],
     "ease": 0.12,
     "cam_id": "guest",
     "push": false
    },
    {
     "who": "panel",
     "text": "Is there a cure?",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep03_54.mp3",
     "shot": "cam",
     "cam": [
      960,
      500,
      1.1
     ],
     "ease": 0.14,
     "cam_id": "two",
     "push": false
    },
    {
     "who": "guest",
     "text": "Not on my chart.",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep03_55.mp3",
     "shot": "cam",
     "cam": [
      2560,
      470,
      1.3
     ],
     "ease": 0.12,
     "cam_id": "guest",
     "push": false
    }
   ]
  },
