   },
   "short": false,
   "hook": "Is this normal in Korea? Ppalli-ppalli",
   "name_chips": true,
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "panel",
     "text": "Time for a new segment: \"Is This Normal in Korea?\" Our expert witness is back: Ms. Nonfic.",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep03_73.mp3",
     "shot": "k_screen",
     "cam_id": "screen_panel",
     "push": false,
     "screen": "normal_q"
    },
    {
     "who": "guest",
     "text": "Exhibit A: the sidewalk. Everyone in Seoul walks like they're late for a flight. They might be.",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep03_74.mp3",
     "shot": "k_screen",
     "cam_id": "screen_guest",
     "push": false,
     "screen": "exhibit"
    },
    {
     "who": "anchor",
     "text": "That's \"ppalli-ppalli.\" It means \"hurry, hurry.\"",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep03_75.mp3",
     "shot": "k_screen",
     "cam_id": "screen_anchor",
     "push": false,
     "screen": "ppalli"
    },
    {
     "who": "guest",
     "text": "It's less a habit than an operating system. Delivery apps promise food in minutes. Some people press the elevator's close button before the doors finish opening.",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep03_76.mp3",
     "shot": "k_screen",
     "cam_id": "screen_guest",
     "push": false,
     "screen": "os"
    },
    {
     "who": "panel",
     "text": "They're not impatient. They're optimistic.",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep03_77.mp3",
     "shot": "cam",
     "cam": [
      960,
      500,
      1.1
     ],
     "ease": 0.14,
     "cam_id": "two",
     "push": false
    },
    {
     "who": "guest",
     "text": "In America, you wait for the pizza. In Korea, the pizza waits for you.",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep03_78.mp3",
     "shot": "cam",
     "cam": [
      2560,
      470,
      1.3
     ],
     "ease": 0.12,
     "cam_id": "guest",
     "push": false
    },
    {
     "who": "panel",
     "text": "So, is this normal in Korea?",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep03_79.mp3",
     "shot": "cam",
     "cam": [
      960,
      500,
      1.1
     ],
     "ease": 0.14,
     "cam_id": "two",
     "push": false
    },
    {
     "who": "guest",
     "text": "Verdict: normal. Please keep moving.",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep03_80.mp3",
     "shot": "k_screen",
     "cam_id": "screen_guest",
     "push": false,
     "screen": "normal"
    },
    {
     "who": "anchor",
     "text": "Welcome to Korea.",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep03_81.mp3",
     "shot": "cam",
     "cam": [
      960,
      500,
      1.1
     ],
     "ease": 0.14,
     "cam_id": "two",
     "push": false
    }
   ]
  },
